# Pull requests on push

After pushing a `dj-XXXX` branch to origin, open or update a PR to `main` using `gh pr create` or `gh pr edit`.

**Title:** `[DJ-XXXX] Brief title` (match the Linear issue)

**Body** (follow `.github/pull_request_template.md`):

```markdown
## Why
[1–2 sentences]

## What
[1–2 sentences]

## Description
[Longer but concise summary]

## Linear
[DJ-XXXX](https://linear.app/dj-project-astradzhao/issue/DJ-XXXX)
```

If a PR already exists for the branch, update title/body instead of creating a duplicate.
